#: ../../functions/func_copymerge.rst:14
msgid "Merges metadata from variable ``old`` into ``new``, removing duplicates and appending to the end, so retaining the original ordering. Like :ref:`func_copy`, this will also copy multi-valued variables without flattening them. Following the operation, ``new`` will be a multi-value variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_copymerge.rst:16
msgid "If ``keep_duplicates`` is set, then the duplicates will not be removed from the result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_copymerge.rst:20
msgid "Unlike most functions, in this case ``new`` and ``old`` are specified **without** enclosing them with percent signs (%)."
msgstr ""

